# Game design

Before planning or changing gameplay systems, combat, loot, pacing, or player-facing mechanics:

1. Read `docs/design/PRINCIPLES.md`
2. Use its quick-reference checklist when evaluating feature ideas

Prefer prediction/learning loops, situation variety over raw number inflation, complete feedback (verbs → confirm → state change → good/bad), and loot that sets up a choice or challenge.
